rule check_result_1 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is true if
    it is not the case that
        a number N is the count of each D such that
            the people of the situation include an id with a date D
            and the id is equal to '$rel'(d_rel_people_ids_of_the_parameters,[text],[item])
        and N = 0
    and a number K is the count of each -1 such that
        the people of the situation include a second id with a second date
        and the second id is equal to '$rel'(d_rel_people_ids_of_the_parameters,[text],[item])
        and it is not the case that true
        and the min age of the parameters is a number M
        and -1 >= M
    and K > 0.

rule check_result_2 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is false if
    it is not the case that
        a number N is the count of each D such that
            the people of the situation include an id with a date D
            and the id is equal to '$rel'(d_rel_people_ids_of_the_parameters,[text],[item])
        and N = 0
    and a number K is the count of each -1 such that
        the people of the situation include a second id with a second date
        and the second id is equal to '$rel'(d_rel_people_ids_of_the_parameters,[text],[item])
        and it is not the case that true
        and the min age of the parameters is a number M
        and -1 >= M
    and K <= 0.

